### ============================================================
### Tania Melo Advocacia — requests de exemplo (todos os endpoints)
### Use com o REST Client do VS Code / IntelliJ HTTP Client.
### Pré-requisito: banco migrado + db/mock-data/seed_mock.sql aplicado.
### IDs de exemplo abaixo são os UUIDs (v4) gerados pelo seed para a
### cliente "Maria Aparecida da Silva" — ajuste se o seed for reaplicado.
### ============================================================

@host = http://localhost:8080
@clientId = 7d7ff165-cb15-481b-8e9a-b755ba876ca1
@addressId = fd8b3b47-b7d0-4f4e-bc71-e0caaab5cd6b
@addressId2 = ea4fcff4-c329-4a44-9a12-4312cf5dbb52
@documentId = 762c9bf3-3ac5-4856-a34d-8b3a47bef9ab
@simulationId = e64ad7ff-1f74-479e-9d64-e113182c9211
@interviewId = 14f828e3-c7a0-4790-a44b-8ced4be6d5b5
@paymentId = dbd42043-8c6a-4587-a0fb-d1e76598bbb3
@paymentId2 = 4de81d53-c8a8-4326-a574-ec9755d76aba

### ── 1. AUTENTICAÇÃO ───────────────────────────────────────

### Login (usuário do seed; senha: password)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "dra.tania@taniamelo.adv.br", "password": "password" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### ── 2. CLIENTE - CLIENTES ─────────────────────────────────

### Listar (filtros padrão: pageNumber/pageSize/searchTerm/benefitType/situation/createdFrom/createdTo)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/clients?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10&searchTerm=maria&situation=Análise documental&createdFrom=2026-01-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar
POST {{host}}/api/v1/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Novo Cliente de Teste",
  "birthDate": "1965-05-20",
  "cpf": "529.982.247-25",
  "motherName": "Mãe do Cliente",
  "mobilePhone": "(31) 91234-5678",
  "inssPassword": "senha-inss",
  "gender": "Masculino",
  "situation": "Formulário preenchido",
  "benefit": "Aposentadoria por idade",
  "clientType": "Potencial"
}

### Detalhe
GET {{host}}/api/v1/clients/{{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualização completa (PUT — objeto completo)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/clients/{{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Maria Aparecida da Silva",
  "birthDate": "1961-03-12",
  "cpf": "390.533.447-05",
  "motherName": "Josefa da Silva",
  "mobilePhone": "(31) 98888-1111",
  "inssPassword": "inss@123",
  "gender": "Feminino",
  "situation": "Planejamento em execução",
  "benefit": "Aposentadoria por idade",
  "profession": "Costureira aposentável",
  "notes": "Atualizado via PUT completo"
}

### Atualização parcial (PATCH — envie só o que quer mudar: situation, benefit, clientType e/ou notBillable)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/clients/{{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "situation": "Planejamento concluído", "clientType": "Verificado", "notBillable": false }

### Excluir cliente
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/clients/{{clientId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ── 3. CLIENTE - DADOS PESSOAIS ───────────────────────────

GET {{host}}/api/v1/clients/{{clientId}}/personal-data
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/clients/{{clientId}}/personal-data
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Maria Aparecida da Silva",
  "birthDate": "1961-03-12",
  "cpf": "390.533.447-05",
  "rg": "MG-11.222.333",
  "rgIssuer": "SSP-MG",
  "rgIssueDate": "1979-06-01",
  "motherName": "Josefa da Silva",
  "gender": "Feminino",
  "maritalStatus": "Casado(a)",
  "nationality": "Brasileira",
  "mobilePhone": "(31) 98888-1111",
  "isWhatsapp": true,
  "referencePhone": "(31) 97777-2222",
  "referenceResponsible": "João da Silva (filho)",
  "email": "maria.silva@gmail.com",
  "hasDisability": false
}

### ── 4. CLIENTE - ENDEREÇO(S) ──────────────────────────────

GET {{host}}/api/v1/clients/{{clientId}}/addresses?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/v1/clients/{{clientId}}/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addressType": "Comercial",
  "street": "Rua Nova",
  "addressNumber": "10",
  "neighborhood": "Centro",
  "city": "Belo Horizonte",
  "state": "MG",
  "zipCode": "30100-000",
  "isPrimary": false
}

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/clients/{{clientId}}/addresses/{{addressId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/clients/{{clientId}}/addresses/{{addressId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "addressType": "Residencial",
  "street": "Rua das Acácias",
  "addressNumber": "128",
  "complement": "Casa",
  "neighborhood": "Santa Efigênia",
  "city": "Belo Horizonte",
  "state": "MG",
  "zipCode": "30240-000",
  "isPrimary": true
}

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/clients/{{clientId}}/addresses/{{addressId2}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ── 5. CLIENTE - DADOS PROFISSIONAIS ──────────────────────

GET {{host}}/api/v1/clients/{{clientId}}/professional-data
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/clients/{{clientId}}/professional-data
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profession": "Costureira",
